# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#  packages.install — what an INSTALLED machine gets
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#  stylus-install reads this file. It exists because the list used to live
#  inside the installer, and the installer came from another distribution: an
#  installed machine got LibreOffice, CUPS and Evince, and did NOT get
#  python-pygame, mpv, steam, flac or any of the rest of STYLUS. Installing
#  STYLUS did not install STYLUS.
#
#  The rule that stops that coming back: everything in packages.x86_64 (the
#  ISO) has to be here too, unless it is in packages.live-only with the reason
#  written down. tools/check.sh enforces it.
#
#  On top of the whole ISO, this adds what only makes sense on a disk: a
#  second kernel, the firewall, the thing that trims the package cache.
#
#  What is NOT here and will not be: an office suite, printing, a photo
#  manager. That is not an oversight, it is what the README says.
#
#  Blank lines and lines starting with # are ignored.
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# ── base and kernel ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
base
linux
linux-headers
linux-firmware
linux-firmware-marvell
sof-firmware
amd-ucode
intel-ucode
mkinitcpio
sudo
polkit
# A second kernel to land on when an update breaks the first one. It is the
# difference between "it does not boot" and "it boots on the second menu line".
linux-lts
linux-lts-headers

# ── the shell you land in ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
fish
bash-completion
less
man-db
man-pages
nano
vim
git
# Claude Code procura com o ripgrep quando ele existe, e cai para uma busca
# muito mais lenta quando não. São cinco megabytes e o `stylus claude` é
# metade da manutenção desta distribuição agora.
ripgrep
rsync
pv
tmux
htop
btop
tree
unzip
zip
7zip
unrar
wget
curl
jq
python
python-pip
# A segunda via do `stylus claude`: quando o instalador oficial não vem
# inteiro, ele cai para `npm install -g --prefix ~/.local`. Só na máquina
# instalada — na ISO seriam sessenta megabytes de RAM para um caminho de
# reserva.
nodejs
npm
xdg-utils
xdg-user-dirs
terminus-font
# A file dialog with no terminal in it: what stylus-pickfolder uses to ask
# where the collection lives. Without it the question falls back to rofi,
# which is a list of paths and not a "choose a folder" window.
zenity
# pacman's own maintenance: the paccache.timer the install enables comes from
# here. Without it the package cache grows until it fills a 32 GB disk.
pacman-contrib
reflector

# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#  AUDIO — the reason this exists
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
pipewire
pipewire-audio
pipewire-alsa
pipewire-pulse
pipewire-jack
wireplumber
rtkit
alsa-utils
alsa-firmware
alsa-plugins
alsa-ucm-conf
qpwgraph
pavucontrol
pamixer
playerctl
spotifyd

# ── bluetooth, with the codecs that are not embarrassing ───────────────────
bluez
bluez-utils
blueman
libldac
libfreeaptx
libfdk-aac

# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#  MUSIC
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
strawberry
mpv
cmus
# The deck and the full-screen shelf are Python. This is their runtime, not
# an extra: /usr/share/stylus/deck and /usr/share/stylus/ui do not start
# without it.
python-numpy
python-pygame
python-pillow
python-mutagen
python-requests
python-gobject
python-musicbrainzngs
python-discid
# The deck captures the playing audio through PortAudio to draw the live
# groove; scope.py imports pyaudio at module load and crashes without it, so
# the deck simply does not open. See the note in packages.x86_64.
python-pyaudio
picard
ffmpeg
sox
flac
opus-tools
lame
wavpack
cuetools
whipper
cdparanoia
cdrdao
libdiscid
yt-dlp
rclone
# rclone monta em espaço de usuário pelo FUSE, e quem faz isso é o
# fusermount3. Sem ele o `stylus webdav` configura tudo certo e falha na
# montagem, que é o pior lugar para descobrir uma dependência.
fuse3

# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#  THE PHONE
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
android-tools
android-udev
mtpfs
gvfs-mtp
libmtp
openssh
syncthing

# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#  GAMES
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
steam
lutris
gamemode
lib32-gamemode
mangohud
lib32-mangohud
gamescope
wine
wine-mono
wine-gecko
winetricks
vkd3d
lib32-vkd3d
vulkan-tools
sdl2-compat
# lib32-sdl2-compat saiu daqui, e não por escolha de projeto: o espelho não o
# serve — nem depois de um `pacman -Sy` na hora, o que descarta lista velha.
# Deve estar em trânsito para o multilib-testing, como acontece quando um
# pacote é reconstruído. Um nome que o pacman não resolve não é um aviso: o
# mkarchiso morre nele, e a ISO inteira não sai por causa de uma biblioteca
# de 32 bits que o Steam e o Wine trazem sozinhos como dependência quando
# precisam. O sdl2-compat de 64 bits continua logo acima.
libgdiplus
gtk3
lib32-gtk3
# Running out of memory on a 4 GB machine does not produce an error, it
# produces a machine that stops answering for minutes. earlyoom kills the
# single worst offender while it still answers. The install enables it.
earlyoom

# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#  GRAPHICS — what fits any card
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#  The vendor driver is chosen by the installer, which by then has seen the
#  card (see MESA_SET/GPU_PKGS in stylus-install). What stays here is what
#  every machine needs: mesa, the Vulkan loader — which is what a game links
#  against — and the software renderer, which is what draws the desktop when
#  the vendor driver does not come up.
mesa
lib32-mesa
mesa-utils
vulkan-icd-loader
lib32-vulkan-icd-loader
vulkan-swrast
lib32-vulkan-swrast
libva-utils

